WEBVTT

00:02.200 --> 00:08.350
The legendary megalith that has absorbed Manon's Hari-san has started moving towards the sundial in Hyakkoku City.

00:09.640 --> 00:17.460
Unbelievably, a fusion between the megalith and the sundial would cause an explosion so huge it would engulf not only Kalos, but the entire world.

00:19.340 --> 00:24.340
As the time limit nears its end, the Gym Leaders of Kalos assemble...

00:36.960 --> 00:39.280
Everyone, aim at that Water Shuriken!

00:39.720 --> 00:40.950
Hari-san is behind it.

00:41.420 --> 00:42.710
Its rescue takes top priority!

00:52.240 --> 00:57.990
Zygarde Fights Back!
The Final Battle for Kalos!!

01:01.660 --> 01:03.010
Pikachu, Iron Tail!

01:06.600 --> 01:07.310
Flamethrower!

01:24.510 --> 01:25.070
Now!

01:30.010 --> 01:30.960
Come on, hurry!

01:33.150 --> 01:34.110
Thank you very much,

01:37.000 --> 01:37.610
Mâche-san!

01:38.050 --> 01:39.000
Don't yuh worry yuhselves!

01:39.440 --> 01:40.640
We will deal with this.

01:40.950 --> 01:42.060
Hurry and save Harimaron!

01:42.330 --> 01:43.120
Understood!

01:45.960 --> 01:46.490
Everyone,

01:47.000 --> 01:47.500
hang in there!

02:04.300 --> 02:04.760
Corni!

02:05.050 --> 02:06.040
Leave this to me!

02:06.270 --> 02:07.480
You guys go on ahead.

02:07.710 --> 02:08.440
Thank you!

02:13.930 --> 02:14.400
Corni!

02:15.300 --> 02:16.990
Don't waste time looking back! Run!

02:18.510 --> 02:18.880
Okay!

02:23.260 --> 02:24.120
Grass Knot!

02:29.330 --> 02:29.870
Fukuji-san!

02:30.280 --> 02:32.260
Who will do it if not you?

02:32.560 --> 02:34.090
Go, Satoshi!

02:47.520 --> 02:48.150
Rock Tomb!

02:54.810 --> 02:55.670
Come on, hurry!

02:57.490 --> 02:57.900
Viola!

02:59.920 --> 03:01.490
Viola-san! Zakuro-san!

03:01.820 --> 03:03.500
Climb over that wall!

03:03.500 --> 03:05.280
You got the opportunity to make a nice shot; don't miss it!

03:16.210 --> 03:17.370
Ice Shard!

03:22.840 --> 03:24.180
Hurry, kids!

03:31.710 --> 03:32.510
There it is!

03:35.990 --> 03:37.280
I'll open up a path!

03:37.720 --> 03:38.810
We're counting on you to save Harimaron!

03:39.700 --> 03:41.120
Leave this...

03:41.730 --> 03:42.780
...to us!

03:44.560 --> 03:45.540
Dark Pulse!

03:50.870 --> 03:51.860
Dragon Rage!

04:01.950 --> 04:02.250
Professor!

04:02.870 --> 04:03.860
Don't stop!

04:04.200 --> 04:04.720
Go!

04:06.000 --> 04:08.490
We can't let everyone's feelings go to waste.

04:13.200 --> 04:13.770
Hari-san...

04:14.700 --> 04:16.830
Everyone's doing their best for you.

04:21.130 --> 04:22.540
Rentorar, Swift!

04:23.080 --> 04:24.400
Horubee, Mud Shot!

04:26.560 --> 04:27.710
Now, please go!

04:28.220 --> 04:29.620
Thank you, Citron!

04:46.390 --> 04:47.720
Don't space out!

04:47.720 --> 04:49.820
Hurry up and save Hari-san!

04:49.820 --> 04:50.820
Move forward, bra-

04:51.450 --> 04:52.270
Rocket Gang!

04:57.760 --> 04:58.240
Are you all right?

04:59.830 --> 05:02.240
The camera is the life of journalism!

05:11.360 --> 05:12.460
Don't worry about the vines.

05:13.160 --> 05:14.730
Move straight forward.

05:15.380 --> 05:16.880
We're entrusting the fate of tomorrow to you!

05:17.220 --> 05:18.520
Psychic!

05:38.760 --> 05:40.120
Why do they go so far to...?

05:40.880 --> 05:42.010
This is how humans...

05:42.580 --> 05:43.920
...and Pokémon are.

05:44.530 --> 05:46.910
Watching them made me realize that.

05:48.800 --> 05:49.350
Over there!

05:52.240 --> 05:53.600
Pikachu, Electro Ball!

05:53.820 --> 05:55.380
Gekkouga, Water Shuriken!

05:55.600 --> 05:57.310
Lizardon, Flamethrower!

06:03.920 --> 06:04.480
Go!

06:04.930 --> 06:05.350
Go!

06:05.830 --> 06:06.850
Go, Satoshi!

06:06.850 --> 06:07.550
There it is!

06:07.810 --> 06:08.510
Yuh must go!

06:08.960 --> 06:09.580
Go!

06:09.850 --> 06:10.620
Force them in there!

06:10.900 --> 06:11.760
Go!

06:11.760 --> 06:12.410
Go!

06:12.810 --> 06:13.520
Go!

06:13.840 --> 06:14.520
Go!

06:14.880 --> 06:15.430
Go!

06:15.790 --> 06:16.430
Go!

06:16.780 --> 06:17.670
Go!

06:17.900 --> 06:18.520
Go!

06:39.810 --> 06:40.540
Harimaron!

06:41.490 --> 06:42.080
Hold on!

06:45.550 --> 06:47.010
Alan, I'll do something about this.

06:47.540 --> 06:48.560
You get Hari-san!

06:50.030 --> 06:51.520
Lizardon, please help us out!

06:52.160 --> 06:52.590
Let's go!

06:58.130 --> 07:00.560
Pikachu, Electro Ball! Gekkouga, Cut!

07:12.040 --> 07:13.120
Everyone, let's go!

07:26.220 --> 07:27.380
Don't stop, Alan!

07:27.670 --> 07:29.290
Gekkouga, Water Shuriken!

07:39.160 --> 07:39.710
Harimaron!

07:40.200 --> 07:40.940
I've come to get you!

07:42.070 --> 07:42.960
Let's go back...

07:43.820 --> 07:44.960
...to Manon together!

07:47.520 --> 07:47.920
Manon!

08:04.940 --> 08:05.760
It's Satoshi and the others!

08:06.330 --> 08:07.000
Hari-san!

08:07.890 --> 08:09.230
They did it!

08:12.490 --> 08:13.550
You did it, Satoshi!

08:13.900 --> 08:14.880
Yahoo!

08:18.900 --> 08:19.600
Marvelous!

08:20.000 --> 08:21.270
Alan, well done.

08:30.820 --> 08:31.400
Hari-san!

08:31.840 --> 08:32.740
Thank goodness.

08:34.300 --> 08:35.450
Thank you, Alan.

08:39.770 --> 08:40.230
All right,

08:40.880 --> 08:42.030
all that's left is that...

08:47.620 --> 08:49.140
Let's all attack in unison!

08:52.250 --> 08:52.640
Now!

09:01.770 --> 09:02.380
Did we do it?

09:16.550 --> 09:17.010
This can't be!

09:17.590 --> 09:18.390
No way!

09:18.660 --> 09:19.030
But...!

09:21.920 --> 09:22.710
Fleur-de-lis...

09:23.600 --> 09:25.250
The time limit is almost up.

09:26.030 --> 09:28.620
The second hand on the clock is moving unstoppably toward the destruction of the world!

09:30.160 --> 09:31.960
Even if I have to exchange my life for it,

09:32.670 --> 09:33.990
I will...

09:34.750 --> 09:35.690
...destroy the world.

09:38.420 --> 09:39.610
Pokémon Quiz.

09:39.610 --> 09:40.710
The answer is...

09:40.950 --> 09:41.970
...uh, you know.

09:52.370 --> 09:53.080
Fleur-de-lis...

09:53.530 --> 09:54.510
You're...

09:55.150 --> 09:57.860
You can't stop the countdown to destruction!

10:03.090 --> 10:03.620
Here it comes!

10:04.270 --> 10:05.050
Light Screen!

10:14.640 --> 10:15.260
It's strong!

10:15.680 --> 10:17.430
So what?!

10:17.430 --> 10:21.170
If that thing reaches the sundial, it's the end of this world!

10:30.550 --> 10:31.040
Pikachu!

10:31.450 --> 10:32.080
Gekkouga!

10:34.860 --> 10:36.440
Lizardon, are you hurt?

10:44.620 --> 10:45.680
Ow...

10:49.900 --> 10:50.370
What?!

10:51.620 --> 10:52.400
Papa?!

10:53.830 --> 10:54.840
My cover's been blown, huh?

10:56.280 --> 10:57.810
Are you all right? Are you hurt?

10:58.580 --> 10:59.470
It's no big deal.

11:00.400 --> 11:01.320
Are you two okay?

11:01.700 --> 11:02.390
Yes.

11:01.700 --> 11:02.390
Yeah.

11:08.410 --> 11:09.350
It's started moving!

11:09.840 --> 11:10.990
If we want to stop that...

11:11.440 --> 11:12.550
Everyone, please listen!

11:12.960 --> 11:17.200
He seems to be using that device on his arm to move the megalith!

11:18.070 --> 11:18.620
In that case,

11:19.110 --> 11:20.070
if we destroy that device...

11:20.630 --> 11:21.450
...it will stop, right?

11:21.900 --> 11:23.070
It is worth a try.

11:23.530 --> 11:25.700
Everyone, summon up all the power you've got left!

11:26.130 --> 11:27.440
Our next attempt will stop it for sure

11:27.760 --> 11:28.330
Yeah!

11:30.800 --> 11:34.260
Are they seriously going to fight that huge malice?

11:34.800 --> 11:36.960
Neither humans nor Pokémon will give up.

11:37.680 --> 11:39.100
They are far too powerless.

11:39.810 --> 11:42.260
<i>They</i> don't think they're powerless.

11:45.200 --> 11:47.280
You must have realized it by now as well.

11:48.440 --> 11:50.140
It is true that humans are powerless,

11:50.550 --> 11:52.240
weak and transient beings.

11:53.240 --> 11:53.490
However...

11:54.000 --> 11:54.850
...they have dreams,

11:55.230 --> 11:56.530
trust each other,

11:57.060 --> 11:58.140
lean on each other...

11:58.390 --> 11:59.360
...and are capable of empathy.

12:00.080 --> 12:00.630
That is...

12:01.160 --> 12:02.660
...their strength.

12:03.960 --> 12:05.780
They believe in their strength...

12:06.410 --> 12:09.060
They have the strength to create something new.

12:29.480 --> 12:31.020
I will believe in these people.

12:31.760 --> 12:32.830
Do you understand us now?

12:33.130 --> 12:33.600
Yeah.

12:36.040 --> 12:36.680
Squishy!

12:36.680 --> 12:37.120
Eureka!

12:37.380 --> 12:37.520
Wait.

12:39.640 --> 12:40.800
We are Zygarde.

12:41.320 --> 12:42.990
We protect the order.

12:44.160 --> 12:45.110
Let us show you...

12:45.600 --> 12:47.270
...our full power!

12:48.000 --> 12:50.040
We will not let the world end!

13:04.500 --> 13:04.960
What is this?!

13:28.200 --> 13:28.810
Squishy...

13:29.900 --> 13:31.230
Is that Zygarde...?

13:32.350 --> 13:34.030
Deep green eyes...

13:34.790 --> 13:35.320
This is...

13:36.220 --> 13:39.390
...the form it takes on when everything comes together.

13:41.160 --> 13:41.880
Everything?

13:42.770 --> 13:45.330
To think you were still hiding such a form...

13:46.030 --> 13:49.130
You must've seen the same world as me.

13:49.890 --> 13:53.550
Didn't you feel anything when you saw how...

13:53.920 --> 13:55.900
...the endless greed of humans disturbed the peace?

13:56.640 --> 13:58.500
If I don't raise my voice,

13:59.040 --> 14:01.270
this world will only get more and more distorted.

14:02.040 --> 14:05.660
You've only just shown up; what can you possibly do to help it?

14:06.420 --> 14:07.830
You have no right!

14:10.670 --> 14:12.930
But these people here do.

14:13.810 --> 14:15.730
We have set our hopes on humans.

14:16.270 --> 14:18.170
She has protected us this whole time.

14:18.980 --> 14:21.170
She promised she would never let us go.

14:21.920 --> 14:23.640
Now it is our turn!

14:23.900 --> 14:26.130
Burn them down!

14:49.760 --> 14:51.400
You cheeky...!

14:51.650 --> 14:52.150
It's that!

14:52.400 --> 14:53.710
Pikachu, Thunderbolt!

14:53.910 --> 14:55.360
Gekkouga, Water Shuriken!

14:56.550 --> 14:58.050
Lizardon, Flamethrower!

15:07.850 --> 15:09.000
It can't be.

15:09.480 --> 15:10.680
This must be some kind of misunderstanding.

15:11.180 --> 15:13.180
My plan is perfect...

15:32.140 --> 15:32.570
Squishy!

15:39.210 --> 15:40.000
Kalos will...

15:41.160 --> 15:42.240
...be protected by us!

15:42.840 --> 15:45.490
Squishy, go!

15:52.190 --> 15:52.730
Not yet.

15:53.040 --> 15:54.120
It's not over yet!

15:54.460 --> 15:54.960
Move!

15:55.210 --> 15:56.620
Move!

16:24.740 --> 16:26.250
I-It's over!

16:27.100 --> 16:29.770
Dear world, look at this conclusion!

16:29.770 --> 16:31.270
The huge object has vanished!

16:31.530 --> 16:33.300
We won!

16:33.980 --> 16:37.450
The threat to Kalos has finally left!

16:42.460 --> 16:44.350
We were able to protect the sundial.

16:44.860 --> 16:46.070
We couldn't have done it without all of you.

16:47.750 --> 16:49.400
We won!

16:53.610 --> 16:54.140
What about Fleur-de-lis?

16:55.340 --> 16:56.000
Who knows...?

16:59.660 --> 17:01.810
I'll deal with the rest of the Flare Gang.

17:03.040 --> 17:05.920
Once I'm done, I'll turn myself in to Junsa-san as well.

17:14.150 --> 17:14.930
Hari-san!

17:15.540 --> 17:18.270
Thank goodness, Hari-san!

17:19.730 --> 17:20.110
Alan!

17:21.660 --> 17:22.810
Look, Hari-san is...!

17:24.170 --> 17:25.580
I'm so glad for you, Harimaron.

17:28.140 --> 17:28.640
Manon...

17:28.840 --> 17:29.020
Hm?

17:30.780 --> 17:31.500
Please forgive me.

17:32.700 --> 17:34.030
I'm sorry for everything that happened until now.

17:34.730 --> 17:35.540
No.

17:36.140 --> 17:36.530
It's okay.

17:37.750 --> 17:39.530
As long as you're all right, it's okay.

17:47.260 --> 17:48.550
Squishy, thank you.

17:49.280 --> 17:49.890
Eureka...

17:50.590 --> 17:53.680
We only did what you did for us, Eureka.

17:54.520 --> 17:55.970
We are the ones who need to say thank you.

17:56.460 --> 17:57.550
We are grateful.

17:58.130 --> 17:58.570
Don't mention it.

18:35.540 --> 18:36.190
We are grateful...

18:36.780 --> 18:38.360
...to you as well.

18:39.140 --> 18:39.890
Thank you.

18:44.230 --> 18:44.880
Eureka,

18:45.950 --> 18:47.960
Meeting and traveling with you has enabled us...

18:48.400 --> 18:49.900
...to understand humans.

18:51.380 --> 18:52.210
We are grateful.

18:53.880 --> 18:54.960
Is this goodbye?

18:55.870 --> 18:57.200
We are a little tired.

18:58.080 --> 18:59.760
We will have a sunbath.

19:01.980 --> 19:03.590
We are glad to have met you.

19:23.020 --> 19:23.830
Eureka is...

19:25.020 --> 19:26.990
...also happy to have met you.

19:29.120 --> 19:29.980
I sincerely...

19:30.700 --> 19:31.340
...thank you.

19:33.760 --> 19:34.810
Squishy...

19:35.770 --> 19:37.430
I love you!

19:57.600 --> 20:01.970
The Flare Gang's ambitions that shook Kalos have now ended.

20:03.520 --> 20:06.960
And in the world that has been protected by Satoshi and his friends, another day begins.

20:08.000 --> 20:08.920
To be continued.

21:40.090 --> 21:41.560
I love Harimaron!

21:42.460 --> 21:45.590
This is a program about Harimaron lovers for Harimaron lovers brought to you by Harimaron lovers:

21:45.590 --> 21:46.640
"I love Harimaron!"

21:46.860 --> 21:48.680
I've found a lovely Harimaron!

21:49.370 --> 21:51.680
It's the Harimaron that belongs to this cute Trainer!

21:51.680 --> 21:53.170
Its name is Hari-san!

21:53.620 --> 21:57.690
Isn't it incredibly cute how it never leaves its partner's side and always supports her?

21:58.300 --> 22:02.100
It appears it always takes care of its scatterbrained Trainer in this manner.

22:02.070 --> 22:03.870
So kind!

22:02.340 --> 22:04.580
Their teamwork in battles is also perfect!

22:04.850 --> 22:07.320
It's a really reliable partner!

22:07.320 --> 22:08.820
Oh my, so cute!

22:08.820 --> 22:10.940
We gotta keep watching this "Hari-san"!

22:16.880 --> 22:19.680
Even <i>I</i> can handle this.

22:28.250 --> 22:29.910
Hari-san, thank you.

22:33.280 --> 22:35.900
We'll have news on the latest video games for you right after this!

22:36.810 --> 22:37.220
Also...

22:38.080 --> 22:41.090
...there are shocking new developments in the anime TV series!

22:41.870 --> 22:46.810
Sunday September 18th at 8am!

22:42.460 --> 22:43.360
Hakkeyoi...

22:42.760 --> 22:44.910
A duel using a gigantic Pokémon paper sumo game!

22:44.210 --> 22:44.510
Nokocchi!

22:45.210 --> 22:46.480
On Sunday at 8am!

22:47.860 --> 22:51.060
The latest video game installments that will go on sale on November 18th are...

22:51.460 --> 22:53.440
...Pocket Monsters Sun and Moon.

22:54.740 --> 22:59.260
The Alola region, which will be the setting of your adventure, is inhabited by lots of new Pokémon you've never seen before!

23:01.490 --> 23:07.010
Not only that, but a new feature called Z-Moves, which are full powered attacks, will appear in battles!

23:07.620 --> 23:09.280
Make sure to get a taste of their awesomeness!

23:10.970 --> 23:11.510
And...

23:13.070 --> 23:15.970
...the TV anime will embark on a new series!

23:16.290 --> 23:17.320
Run away!

23:17.320 --> 23:21.470
Satoshi and Pikachu go on a full-powered adventure with the Alola region as its setting!

23:22.460 --> 23:23.240
Alola!

23:23.240 --> 23:23.710
And...

23:24.100 --> 23:26.370
Together with his friends, he experiences school life?!

23:24.800 --> 23:25.710
Nice to meet you!

23:25.930 --> 23:27.270
It is Grass/Dragon.

23:26.950 --> 23:27.690
What does this mean?!

23:27.270 --> 23:28.510
Grass/Dragon?

23:29.070 --> 23:30.740
Go, Pikachu!

23:29.990 --> 23:33.040
On top of that, you get an explosion of fully powered Z-Moves!

23:33.750 --> 23:38.380
The new series "Pocket Monsters Sun & Moon" will start airing in November!

23:38.380 --> 23:39.460
Yahoo!

23:39.030 --> 23:39.870
Look forward to it!

23:43.010 --> 23:44.920
All right, everyone! Let's go together!

23:45.120 --> 23:46.210
Towards our next adventure!

23:47.240 --> 24:07.090
The next episode will air Thursday October 6th at 6:55pm!!

23:47.240 --> 24:07.090
There will be a break September 22nd and 29th.

23:47.310 --> 23:48.040
Citroid...

23:48.470 --> 23:49.860
I will fix you for sure!

23:50.650 --> 23:51.220
Bro!

23:51.870 --> 23:52.640
It's working.

23:52.910 --> 23:53.220
Yeah!

23:54.200 --> 23:55.310
I am the Citroid.

23:56.200 --> 23:57.080
It is a pleasure to meet you.

23:57.630 --> 23:58.130
Huh?

23:58.820 --> 24:00.580
The Citroid's memory has been...

24:01.610 --> 24:04.270
Next time on Pocket Monsters XY&Z:

24:04.580 --> 24:07.300
We Start at Zero! Citron's Decision!!

24:07.300 --> 24:10.760
Next Time

24:07.300 --> 24:10.760
We Start at Zero!
Citron's Decision!!

24:08.030 --> 24:10.000
Everyone, get Pokémon!

24:10.760 --> 24:25.870
Next episode:

24:10.760 --> 24:18.270
The first challenger after the reopening of the Gym

24:11.300 --> 24:15.070
This program was brought to you by these sponsors.

24:18.340 --> 24:25.870
His battle opponent is... the Citroid!?
